# Files with no part in serving a request on Vercel, kept out of the upload.
#
# server.js is the entry point for a long-lived process — npm start, the
# Dockerfile, Render — and api/index.js is the entry here, so nothing the
# function requires reaches it. Bundle hygiene only: it was not the cause of the
# landing page failing, which was module-scope throws during the runtime's eager
# load of the module graph. See config/requirements.js.
